From bffa85b1dc1cba163503c24fedb034e26fe7f230 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: duckfamily <156525766+duckfamily@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 02:33:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] Add ghost mode, spy mode and ad removal

Ghost mode suppresses read receipts, story views, online status and typing
progress. Spy mode keeps deleted messages and edit history locally, in the
account's existing encrypted storage rather than a plaintext database
beside it. Ads and promotions are dropped before they reach the UI.

Behaviour inspired by AyuGram Desktop 6.7.8. No code was copied; preserve
both projects' GPL attribution when distributing corresponding source.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
